  {
   "id": "decision-07",
   "status": "resolved",
   "resolution": "Root capacity and registry storage are reserved before start acceptance; resume admits, submits, registers, and publishes the complete reconstructed runnable set atomically or rolls it back without semantic change.",
   "normative_requirements": [
    "GNT-15.1-automatic-execution",
